#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:2
msgid "迁移学习分类体系"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{ref}`transfer-learning-intro` "
"中我们理解了迁移学习的核心动机：借用源领域的知识解决目标领域的问题。但\"迁移\"这个词很宽泛——"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:6
msgid "是用 ImageNet 预训练模型做医学影像分类？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:7
msgid "是把英文情感分析模型迁移到中文？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:8
msgid "还是让模型同时学习多个相关任务？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:10
msgid "这些都是迁移学习，但技术路线完全不同。**本章将建立一套分类体系，帮助你在面对具体问题时快速找到合适的方法**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:12
msgid "按迁移情境分类"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:14
#, python-brace-format
msgid "根据源域与目标域的关系，迁移学习可分为三类 {cite}`pan2010survey`："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:16
msgid "**归纳式迁移学习**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:18
msgid "**定义**：源域和目标域的**任务不同**。这是最常见的场景。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:20
msgid "用 ImageNet 预训练模型做医学影像分类——同样是\"看图\"，但分类的内容从\"猫还是狗\"变成了\"有没有病灶\"。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:22
msgid "**直推式迁移学习**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:24
msgid "**定义**：源域和目标域的**任务相同**但**数据来源不同**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:26
msgid "在英文新闻上训练的情感分析模型，迁移到中文社交媒体文本——任务都是\"判断情绪\"，但语言不同了。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:28
msgid "核心挑战是**领域偏移**：同样的任务，不同的数据分布。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:30
msgid "**无监督迁移学习**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:32
msgid "**定义**：源域和目标域**都不需要标注数据**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:34
msgid "用自监督预训练的特征提取器，直接对新领域的图像做聚类——全程不需要任何人标注。"
msgstr ""

