#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:42
msgid "这三类中，**归纳式覆盖了绝大多数实际场景**——你几乎总是在用预训练模型解决一个新任务。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:44
msgid "按迁移方法分类"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:46
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"知道\"属于哪种情境\"只是第一步，更关键的问题是：**知识到底怎么从源域搬到目标域？** 根据迁移机制，可分为四类 "
"{cite}`zhuang2020comprehensive`："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:49
msgid "1. 基于模型的迁移"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:51
msgid "**核心思想**：直接复用预训练模型的参数和结构。这是**最常用、最高效**的方法。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:53
msgid "**类比**：你刚拿到驾照（预训练模型），现在要开一辆不熟悉的车——方向盘、刹车、油门的**基本操作都一样**，你只需要适应新车的**手柄位置和刹车灵敏度**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:55
msgid "**这条路的灵魂：冻结与解冻**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:57
msgid "神经网络像一栋多层建筑："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md
msgid "楼层"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md
msgid "学到的内容"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md
msgid "通用程度"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md
msgid "迁移时的策略"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md
msgid "底层"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md
msgid "边缘、颜色、纹理"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md
msgid "最通用"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md
msgid "**冻结**——任何任务都用得上"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md
msgid "中层"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md
msgid "形状、部件、组合"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md
msgid "较通用"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md
msgid "微调或冻结——看任务相似度"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md
msgid "顶层"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md
msgid "语义、物体类别"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md
msgid "最特定"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md
msgid "**替换**——重新学分类头"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:65
msgid "**关键决策**就是决定哪些层\"冻结\"（保留预训练知识不动）和哪些层\"解冻\"（允许在新任务上调整）。这个决策直接决定了迁移效果——冻太多则适应不足，冻太少则知识丢失。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:67
#, python-brace-format
msgid "展开讲：{doc}`part3-model-transfer` 将详细覆盖特征提取、微调、分层学习率和渐进解冻等实践技巧。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:70
msgid "2. 基于特征的迁移"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:72
msgid "**核心思想**：学习一个\"翻译层\"，把源域和目标域的特征映射到同一个空间，让模型分不出数据来自哪个域。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:74
msgid ""
"**类比**：两台相机拍同一个场景——iPhone "
"的照片鲜艳，老式手机的照片暗淡。基于特征的方法就是找到一种\"滤镜\"，让两种照片看起来风格统一，这样用 iPhone "
"照片训练的模型也能识别老式手机拍的内容。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:76
msgid "**什么时候用**：源域和目标域差异很大（如游戏画面 → 真实街景），直接用模型迁移效果差时。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:79
msgid "3. 基于实例的迁移"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:81
msgid "**核心思想**：给源域中\"跟目标域长得像\"的样本更高权重，让模型专注于有用的那部分数据。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:83
msgid "**类比**：你要用一本通用百科全书（源域）来准备一场生物考试（目标域）。不需要整本背诵——只需要把\"动物\"\"植物\"\"细胞\"相关的词条标亮，重点复习。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:85
msgid "**什么时候用**：源域大而杂、只有部分内容与目标域相关。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:88
msgid "4. 基于关系的迁移"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:90
msgid "**核心思想**：迁移数据之间的**逻辑关系**或知识结构，而不是单个样本或特征。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:92
msgid "**类比**：学生学了\"苹果和香蕉都是水果\"后，能自动推断\"草莓也是水果\"——这不是因为见过草莓，而是掌握了\"水果\"这个概念的关系网。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/transfer-learning/part2-taxonomy.md:94
msgid "**什么时候用**：数据具有明确的结构化关系（推荐系统、知识图谱）。"
msgstr ""

